# oracle: kspace_style msm with mixed boundaries p p f (periodic ghosts in x and y, the top level summed in full over one period in x and y and the non-periodic z), order 6, cutoff/adjust yes, pressure/scalar no, kspace_modify slab 3.0 (warned about and ignored by MSM), pair lj/cut/coul/msm, a rocksalt slab of 144 ions, NVE, 40 steps.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 2.3e-11, atoms 8.1e-14.
units           metal
atom_style      charge
boundary        p p f
lattice         fcc 5.64
region          box block 0 3 0 3 -2 3
create_box      2 box
region          slab block 0 3 0 3 0 1
create_atoms    1 region slab
lattice         fcc 5.64 origin 0.5 0.0 0.0
create_atoms    2 region slab
mass            1 22.99
mass            2 35.45
set             type 1 charge 1.0
set             type 2 charge -1.0
variable        dx atom 0.12*sin(0.53*x+0.21*y)
variable        dy atom 0.12*cos(0.37*y-0.19*z)
variable        dz atom 0.12*sin(0.29*z+0.41*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
velocity        all create 300.0 87287 dist gaussian
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/msm 7.0
pair_coeff      1 1 0.0100 2.35
pair_coeff      2 2 0.0050 4.40
pair_coeff      1 2 0.0070 3.00
kspace_style    msm 1.0e-4
kspace_modify   order 6 pressure/scalar no slab 3.0
timestep        0.001
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step temp pe evdwl ecoul elong etotal press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             40
